528	     * Reports whether the given business-day {@code registrationDate} is a bulk-signup day, i.e.
529	     * whether more than {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already carry that date. The
530	     * count is taken against the same adjusted date owners are stored with, mirroring the
531	     * per-day create-limit accumulation. A {@code null} date is never a bulk-signup day.
