610	     * Counts the existing owners that share the given {@code firstName} and {@code lastName}
611	     * with the owner being created, compared case-insensitively. The count is taken before the
612	     * new owner is persisted, so it reflects only pre-existing owners and never includes the new
613	     * owner itself. The resulting value is stored on the owner and exposed as {@code namesakeCount}.
614	     *
615	     * @param firstName the first name of the owner being created
616	     * @param lastName the last name of the owner being created
617	     * @return the number of pre-existing owners sharing the same first and last name
618	     */
619	    private int countNamesakes(String firstName, String lastName) {
